WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.917
This Android guide uses the Google Contacts app. Other phone apps may look different.

2
00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:09.625
Open the Google Contacts app on your Android phone.

3
00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:13.833
Tap Fix and manage, then choose Export to file.

4
00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:18.167
Select the account or accounts whose contacts you want to export.

5
00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:22.458
Tap Export to VCF and save the file where you can find it.

6
00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:29.083
In Gold Mine Genie, choose the VCF file in Import Studio and review the contacts before saving.
